Package: graft
Title: Persistent Artifacts and Shared Vocabulary
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("James", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "github@jameshwade.com")
Description: Retains exact immutable artifacts, dependency selections, and
    explicit host acceptance and withdrawal decisions across R workflows.
    Publishes shared concepts and relationships bound to pinned data-dict
    dictionaries. Applications own scientific validation, access policy,
    execution, and decisions about when retained evidence may be reused.
